Hi Zachary,

Order 260430-3541 was delivered 05/01/2026 -- thanks for going with
VasoGuard. Now that the box is open, a couple of quick things to make sure
the install lands cleanly:

*Onboarding checklist (15 minutes total)*

    1. Verify the system boots and the probe registers (~3 min)
    2. Run a self-test ABI on a staff volunteer (~5 min)
    3. Confirm protocols match your service line (~5 min)
    4. Connect to the corvascular.com customer portal for software updates

I block 30-min slots Tue-Thu for protocol setup walk-throughs at no
charge. If your team would benefit from one, reply with two windows that
work and I'll send a calendar hold.

Two other things while we're talking:

- *Cuff stock*  -- if you're not already on a recurring cuff order, we can
  add you to the standing-order list (saves the buyer 10 minutes a month).

- *Other AMI sites*  -- AMI has multiple imaging locations. If anyone else
  on your team is evaluating ABI / vascular testing, a single referral
  intro is worth a $500 amazon card to you under our customer-referral
  program.

Welcome aboard.

Spencer

